@startuml 交互式HTML生成 - 组件架构图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam componentBorderColor #333333
skinparam arrowColor #333333

title OpenMAIC 交互式HTML生成 - 组件架构与依赖关系

package "前端层" {
  [InteractiveRenderer] as Renderer
  [App.vue] as App
  [Scene] as Scene
}

package "业务逻辑层" {
  [generateInteractiveContent] as Generator
  [generateSceneActions] as ActionGenerator
  [createSceneWithActions] as SceneCreator
}

package "工具层" {
  [buildPrompt] as PromptBuilder
  [extractHtml] as HtmlExtractor
  [postProcessInteractiveHtml] as HtmlProcessor
  [parseJsonResponse] as JsonParser
}

package "Prompt系统" {
  [PROMPT_IDS] as PromptIds
  [interactive-scientific-model] as ScientificPrompt
  [interactive-html] as HtmlPrompt
  [interactive-actions] as ActionPrompt
}

package "类型定义" {
  [SceneOutline] as OutlineType
  [InteractiveContent] as ContentType
  [GeneratedInteractiveContent] as GeneratedType
  [ScientificModel] as ModelType
  [Action] as ActionType
}

package "外部服务" {
  [OpenAI GPT-4o-mini] as AIModel
  [Vercel AI SDK] as AISDK
  [KaTeX] as KatexLib
  [Tailwind CSS] as Tailwind
}

'用户' --> App: 输入概念信息

App --> Generator: 调用生成函数
App --> ActionGenerator: 调用动作生成

Generator --> PromptBuilder: 构建科学建模Prompt
Generator --> PromptBuilder: 构建HTML生成Prompt
ActionGenerator --> PromptBuilder: 构建动作生成Prompt

PromptBuilder --> PromptIds: 获取Prompt ID
PromptIds --> ScientificPrompt: 加载system.md
PromptIds --> ScientificPrompt: 加载user.md
PromptIds --> HtmlPrompt: 加载system.md
PromptIds --> HtmlPrompt: 加载user.md
PromptIds --> ActionPrompt: 加载system.md
PromptIds --> ActionPrompt: 加载user.md

PromptBuilder --> AISDK: 调用generateText()
AISDK --> AIModel: 发送请求
AIModel --> AISDK: 返回响应
AISDK --> Generator: 返回AI响应
AISDK --> ActionGenerator: 返回AI响应

Generator --> JsonParser: 解析ScientificModel
JsonParser --> Generator: 返回解析结果
ActionGenerator --> JsonParser: 解析Action数组
JsonParser --> ActionGenerator: 返回解析结果

Generator --> HtmlExtractor: 提取HTML
HtmlExtractor --> Generator: 返回RawHTML

Generator --> HtmlProcessor: 后处理HTML
HtmlProcessor --> Generator: 返回ProcessedHTML

Generator --> SceneCreator: 创建Scene
ActionGenerator --> SceneCreator: 传递Actions
SceneCreator --> Scene: 生成Scene对象

Scene --> App: 传递Scene
App --> Renderer: 传递InteractiveContent

Renderer --> Tailwind: 使用样式
Renderer --> KatexLib: 渲染公式

note right of Generator
  **generateInteractiveContent**
  
  输入: SceneOutline, AICallFn, language
  输出: GeneratedInteractiveContent
  
  流程:
  1. 科学建模 (可选)
  2. HTML生成
  3. HTML提取
  4. 后处理
end note

note right of HtmlProcessor
  **postProcessInteractiveHtml**
  
  功能:
  1. LaTeX分隔符转换
  2. KaTeX库注入
  3. MutationObserver监听
  
  输入: RawHTML
  输出: ProcessedHTML
end note

note right of PromptBuilder
  **buildPrompt**
  
  功能:
  1. 加载Prompt模板
  2. 插入变量
  3. 返回system和user prompt
  
  变量插值:
  - {{conceptName}}
  - {{subject}}
  - {{keyPoints}}
  - {{scientificConstraints}}
  - {{designIdea}}
  - {{language}}
end note

note bottom of App
  **App.vue职责**
  
  1. 用户输入管理
  2. 调用生成函数
  3. 错误处理
  4. 状态管理
  5. 渲染结果
end note

note bottom of Renderer
  **InteractiveRenderer职责**
  
  1. Iframe CSS补丁
  2. 沙箱安全隔离
  3. HTML内容注入
  4. KaTeX自动渲染
  5. 用户交互支持
end note

@enduml
